    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's common... but it doesn't make it feel any less lonely. it just feels like i'm watching a movie that i've already seen the end of, but no one invited me to the sequel. there's no point in trying to learn a new language when everyone has already stopped speaking yours. i'm just tired of trying to fit into a shape that doesn't exist anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
